<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>彭博社 实时热点</title><link>https://feeds.bloomberg.com/markets/news.rss</link><description>彭博社 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 08:10:05 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>南非薪资政策势头减弱，支持率达 51%</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/pay-policy-at-south-africa-s-momentum-passes-with-51-support</link><description>Momentum Group Ltd. 的股东以微弱优势批准了这家南非保险公司的薪酬政策，因为新规则赋予该国公司的投资者对薪酬更大的发言权。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/pay-policy-at-south-africa-s-momentum-passes-with-51-support'&gt;南非薪资政策势头减弱，支持率达 51%&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Pay Policy at South Africa’s Momentum Passes With 51% Support&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/pay-policy-at-south-africa-s-momentum-passes-with-51-support</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:42:09 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>关注 2027 年石油市场库存：能源方面</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video</link><description>Energy Aspects Ltd 表示，石油库存将是未来几年的重要因素，即使在预计全球出现盈余的情况下，也可能导致市场收紧并提振价格（来源：彭博社）&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video'&gt;关注 2027 年石油市场库存：能源方面&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Watch Stockpiling in Oil Markets in 2027: Energy Aspects&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/watch-stockpiling-in-oil-markets-in-2027-energy-aspects-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:45:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</link><description>日本烟草公司股价上涨，此前有消息称该卷烟制造商正在探索与奥驰亚集团公司收购帝国品牌公司的可能性。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover'&gt;日本烟草股价因帝国品牌潜在收购而上涨&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Japan Tobacco Climbs on Potential Imperial Brands Takeover&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/japan-tobacco-shares-climb-on-potential-imperial-brands-takeover</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 00:26:05 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>中东和非洲地平线 2026 年 11 月 27 日（视频）</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-27-2026-video</link><description>&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-27-2026-video'&gt;中东和非洲地平线 2026 年 11 月 27 日（视频）&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Horizons Middle East &amp; Africa 11/27/2026 (Video)&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/videos/2026-11-27/horizons-middle-east-africa-11-27-2026-video</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:52:46 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹</title><link>https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</link><description>美国股市有望反弹，纳斯达克 100 指数跌至熊市边缘后，风险偏好有所回升。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [彭博社] &lt;a href='https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday'&gt;假期过后风险偏好回升 美股将反弹&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：US Stocks Set to Bounce as Risk Appetite Returns After Holiday&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-11-27/us-stocks-set-to-bounce-as-risk-appetite-returns-after-holiday</guid><pubDate>Fri, 27 Nov 2026 07:56:20 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>